    <innerclass refid="class_non_mass_based_dynamics" prot="public">NonMassBasedDynamics</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_non_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonMassBasedDynamics</ref> class, a <ref refid="class_dynamics" kindref="compound">Dynamics</ref> subclass not dependent on mass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines a class that represents dynamics which do not depend on the mass of the entity. It inherits from the abstract base class <ref refid="class_dynamics" kindref="compound">Dynamics</ref> and can be serialized using Boost. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
